{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "情绪连接的五项关键技能", "content": "根据美国国家安全和支持性学习环境中心的研究，强烈的情绪发展会导致五项关键技能：自我认知、社会意识、情绪调节、负责任的决策以及建立关系。这些技能反过来会影响孩子在学习、家庭、社区、工作岗位和社会上的成功。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪连接", "关键技能", "自我认知", "社会意识", "情绪调节", "负责任的决策", "建立关系"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00001"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a002", "kind": "causes", "condition": "如果缺乏情绪连接", "reason": "a001指出情绪发展导致关键技能，a002说明缺乏情绪连接导致儿童在情感、学术等方面挣扎，因此缺乏情绪连接会导致关键技能发展受阻。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-10", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：良好的情绪联结有助于孩子发展；新库仅聚焦五项关键技能，旧库还包括前提地位和失败后果。", "reason": "新库具体列出情绪发展带来的五项关键技能（自我认知、社会意识、情绪调节、负责任的决策、建立关系），与旧库中的技能清单一致，但旧库为复合概念。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "缺乏情绪连接对儿童的影响", "content": "没有得到过情感指导、没有获得过父母情绪连接的孩子，在情感、学术、身体健康和行为健康上经常挣扎。这些孩子往往没有办法表达、控制、关注和理解自己的情绪，导致他们在集中精力学习、做作业、结交朋友或团队合作上非常困难。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪连接", "情感指导", "儿童发展", "社交困难"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "情绪连接促进关键技能，缺乏则导致困难", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "社交恐惧症与情绪连接缺失的关联", "content": "现在越来越多的社交恐惧症，是因为孩子的父母要出去挣钱、工作上有成就，而让孩子越来越少的情绪连接所造成。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["社交恐惧症", "情绪连接", "父母角色"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["因果推断需核验：社交恐惧症成因复杂，不能简单归因于情绪连接缺失"], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a002", "kind": "causes", "condition": "情绪连接缺失可能导致社交恐惧症", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "社交恐惧症作为缺乏情绪连接的一个后果", "reason": "a003提到社交恐惧症因情绪连接减少造成，a002提到缺乏情绪连接导致社交困难，两者相互印证。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "五岁前是情绪连接的关键窗口期", "content": "五岁之前的儿童，情绪连接是一个非常关键的成长小窗口。如果在这个时期培养好孩子的情绪连接，过后再培养其他方面会特别容易；如果这段时间没有培养好，过后也可以再连接，但所花的时间和精力会困难很多。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["情绪连接", "关键期", "五岁前", "窗口期"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a008", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "五岁前是情绪连接关键窗口期", "reason": "a004强调五岁前情绪连接关键，a008提供0-2岁情绪连接的前提条件，说明早期建立情绪连接的重要性。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "五岁前情绪连接窗口期", "reason": "源强调0-2岁是发现情绪的关键，候选5提出五岁前是情绪连接的关键窗口期，都关注早期情绪发展关键期，但侧重点不同（发现 vs 连接），故关联。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "关于婴儿出生时情绪的不同理论", "content": "关于情绪如何发展和起作用，心理学上有很多不同理论。一种认为出生时只有三种情绪：幸福、愤怒和恐惧；另一种说法认为婴儿从出生开始就有很多各种各样的感受，只是因为婴儿无法说话，所以不能确定。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪理论", "婴儿情绪", "心理学"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["理论争议，需核验具体来源"], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "婴儿通过哭泣和声音交流", "content": "婴儿通过哭泣和咕咕的声音，肯定可以交流一些东西。在这个阶段，婴儿在发现他所处的世界是不是一个好东西，比如是否得到拥抱、亲吻、轻柔的声音抚摸；还是坏东西，比如胀满的尿布、肚子饿、刺耳的噪音。婴儿开始注意到周遭环境对他们造成的不同感受。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["婴儿交流", "哭泣", "环境感受"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00006", "b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "婴儿在不能说话时已储存情绪", "content": "现在的研究越来越倾向于，婴儿在虽然不能说话的时候，其实已经有更多的情绪储存起来了，只是婴儿自己也不知道，而且也没办法表达出来。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["婴儿情绪", "情绪储存", "研究倾向"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["研究倾向需核验具体证据"], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a005", "kind": "supports", "condition": "支持婴儿有多种情绪的观点", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "0-2岁情绪连接的前提：创建安全一致的环境", "content": "0-2岁情绪连接的前提条件是创建一个安全、一致的环境，这是孩子们可以自信地探索和表达自己的发射台。当孩子知道父母在身边时，他们更愿意去冒险和探索未知的世界。孩子天生就有与周围人交流、倾诉的需要和愿望。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["安全环境", "情绪连接", "0-2岁", "探索"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a009", "kind": "causes", "condition": "创建安全一致的环境", "reason": "a008指出安全环境是情绪连接前提，a009说明早期积极关系奠定社会情感发展基础，安全环境促进积极关系。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "早期积极关系奠定社会情感发展基础", "content": "如果父母在早期与儿童建立非常积极的关系，孩子就会感觉到安全有保障，为他将来健康的社会和情感发展奠定很好的基础。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["积极关系", "安全依恋", "社会情感发展"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a008", "kind": "supports", "condition": "安全环境促进积极关系", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "鼓励婴儿自我安抚（吃手指）", "content": "在0-2岁，婴儿不舒服就哭。很多父母容易做错：孩子一哭就去抱起来哄。其实要借着这个时间鼓励孩子自我安慰（英文单词south，应为soothe）。例如孩子吃手指是自我安抚的好办法，不要阻止。这是孩子开始调节自己情绪的第一步。如果希望孩子将来更好地表达情绪并管控情绪背后的行为，一定要允许孩子通过自己的方式安抚自己。", "steps": ["孩子哭时，不要立即抱起", "允许孩子吃手指等自我安抚行为", "在安全的情况下，不要阻止"], "conditions": ["安全的情况下"], "limits": ["反对哭声免疫法"], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["自我安抚", "吃手指", "情绪调节", "0-2岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["英文单词south应为soothe，原文可能有误"], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00009", "b00010", "b00011"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a011", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "与哭声免疫法不同，允许自我安抚但非完全放任", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a011", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "关于孩子哭时的回应方式", "reason": "a010鼓励自我安抚，反对立即抱起；a011反对哭声免疫法但允许在安全情况下让孩子哭一阵，两者在具体做法上有差异。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "婴儿0-2岁，出现哭闹等情绪时", "reason": "源指出0-2岁是父母发现孩子情绪的关键时期，候选10提供该阶段鼓励婴儿自我安抚的具体方法（吃手指），有助于孩子情绪调节，是发现情绪过程中的具体支持，故关联。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "anti-pattern", "subtype": "counterexample", "title": "反对哭声免疫法", "content": "讲师非常反对哭声免疫法。但在安全的情况下，不要孩子一哭就抱，让他哭一阵，用监视器看着确定安全。前提是确定孩子吃饱了、尿布干爽，然后让他哭一下没有问题。", "steps": [], "conditions": ["确定孩子吃饱了", "尿布干爽", "安全监视"], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["哭声免疫法", "反对", "安全"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["哭声免疫法有争议，需核验；此处为讲师观点"], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a010", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "反对完全放任，但允许短暂哭泣", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "表达情感：匹配孩子的面部表情", "content": "无论在哪一个阶段，孩子一定会模仿父母。要让孩子表达情感，父母在家要喜欢跟孩子诉说情绪。在这个阶段，匹配孩子的面部表情来表达感受。例如孩子笑，就说“哇，好开心呐”，帮助孩子注意到他们的情绪与父母的情绪有连接。孩子哭时不要笑，要匹配上去，如“哎呦，妈妈好担心啊，怎么了？”", "steps": ["观察孩子的面部表情", "用语言和表情匹配孩子的情绪", "孩子笑时表达开心，孩子哭时表达担心"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪表达", "模仿", "面部表情", "情绪连接"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a013", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "0-2岁情绪连接方法", "reason": "a012提到匹配面部表情，a013列出0-2岁情绪连接的具体方法，包括面部表情回应，因此a012是a013方法的一部分。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "0-2岁情绪连接的具体方法", "content": "0-2岁情绪连接的方法：1. 温柔的声音：孩子靠听觉、视觉和身体触觉进行情绪连接，醒时轻轻说话。2. 大量的身体接触：如皮肤接触，医生鼓励解开衣服抱孩子。3. 用面部表情回应孩子。4. 及时满足孩子的正常生理需要（不是随时满足），如喝水、吃饭、换尿布。", "steps": ["用温柔的声音与孩子说话", "进行皮肤接触和拥抱", "用面部表情回应", "及时满足生理需要"], "conditions": ["正常生理需要"], "limits": ["不是随时满足，而是及时满足正常需要"], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["情绪连接", "0-2岁", "温柔声音", "身体接触", "及时满足"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016", "b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a008", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "安全环境是前提，这些是具体方法", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a014", "kind": "supports", "condition": "及时满足生理需要", "reason": "a013提到及时满足生理需要，a014强调生理需要不应作为惩罚，两者都强调满足生理需要的重要性。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "生理需要不应作为惩罚", "content": "孩子的生理需要绝对不应该被父母作为任何要挟或惩罚的条件。不管孩子做错什么，不可以不给他吃饭、喝水。生理需要不是惩罚孩子的工具。自然后果是另外一回事，但生理需要绝不是惩罚。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["生理需要", "惩罚", "界限"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00017", "b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "罗马尼亚孤儿院案例：情绪失联导致冷漠", "content": "罗马尼亚有很多孤儿，父母无法养育，政府收留。心理学家到孤儿院做义工时，以为会听到孩子此起彼伏的哭声，但惊讶地发现没有孩子哭，每个孩子都安安静静躺在小床上。后来发现，因为护士无法每个孩子一哭就抱，孩子们知道再怎么哭也得不到照顾，所以不哭了。整个孤儿院安安静静。这个案例说明，如果孩子不哭，可能已经对父母不抱期待和希望，不信任父母。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["依赖与失控"], "tags": ["罗马尼亚孤儿院", "情绪失联", "冷漠", "信任"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": ["案例来源需核验，可能为转述"], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00018", "b00019", "b00020", "b00021"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a002", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "缺乏情绪连接导致冷漠", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a016", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "孩子不哭可能表示不信任", "reason": "a015用罗马尼亚孤儿院案例说明孩子不哭是因为不期待照顾，a016从心理学角度解释孩子哭闹是信任的表现，案例支持该观点。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-ca-04", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：婴儿期哭泣长期得不到回应；孩子不再哭泣且失去信任", "reason": "候选案例是罗马尼亚孤儿院案例，与旧知识描述的大规模收留机构一致，结论相同：孩子不哭不是乖，而是放弃期待、不信任。内容及条件基本等价。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "孩子哭闹是信任的表现", "content": "从心理学角度，父母应该很高兴孩子不舒服会哭，因为如果孩子不哭，就像罗马尼亚孤儿一样，说明他对父母已经不抱任何期待和希望，已经不信任父母。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["依赖与失控"], "tags": ["哭闹", "信任", "情绪表达"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00021"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a015", "kind": "supports", "condition": "孤儿院案例支持此观点", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-ca-04", "kind": "complements", "condition": "补充概念：孩子哭闹是信任的表现；该概念进一步解释不哭的含义", "reason": "从案例提炼概念，强调不哭代表不信任，补充了旧知识未明确的一般性判断。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "3-4岁是表达情绪的时刻", "content": "3-4岁是表达情绪的时刻，孩子需要表达情绪。这个阶段被称为“可怕的两岁，恐怖的三岁”，孩子进入说“不”的时期，随着词汇量增加和独立性增强，开始尝试用新方式表达情感，如扔东西、打人、尖叫。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["3-4岁", "情绪表达", "可怕的两岁", "恐怖的三岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00021", "b00022", "b00023"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a018", "kind": "supports", "condition": "3-4岁是表达情绪的关键期", "reason": "a017指出3-4岁是表达情绪的时刻，a018强调该时期是健康表达情绪能力建立的时期，两者一致。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "3-4岁是健康表达情绪能力建立的时期", "content": "3-4岁是健康表达情绪能力建立的时期，孩子在这个时期没有能力，往往用哭闹、尖叫等方式表达情绪。对父母来说这个阶段虽然艰难痛苦，但极其宝贵，因为抓好这段时间，将来孩子在情绪表达方面可以省掉很多猜的心思。早一点吃苦，后面就少受点苦；如果打压孩子不准哭，孩子大一点日子就更难过。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["情绪表达", "能力建立", "3-4岁", "关键期"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00023", "b00024"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a017", "kind": "supports", "condition": "此阶段是表达情绪的关键", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "3-4岁孩子经历复杂情绪但不知如何表达", "content": "3-4岁孩子经历很多复杂情绪，理解感受到这些情绪让他们觉得害怕，因为不知道这是什么，也不知道怎样有力量地健康表达。所以哭闹、扔东西、打砸都是在健康探索。父母要进行指导，帮助孩子知道“我明白你的感受，你不要着急，我们一起来梳理”。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["复杂情绪", "健康探索", "父母指导"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a019", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00024", "b00025"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a020", "kind": "causes", "condition": "孩子经历复杂情绪但不知如何表达", "reason": "a019说明孩子因复杂情绪而哭闹，a020指出父母要理解孩子发脾气的原因，因为孩子不明白情绪，所以需要理解。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u019"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "3-4岁情绪连接的前提：理解孩子发脾气", "content": "3-4岁情绪连接的前提条件：第一，当孩子乱发脾气时，父母一定要理解孩子为什么乱发脾气。孩子不明白为什么有这些脾气，内心害怕、恐惧、抓狂，如果父母也抓狂，孩子更抓狂。孩子乱发脾气是发展中非常正常且健康的部分，因为情绪表达能力超出语言表达能力时，他们唯一知道的方法就是乱发脾气，用身体表达。父母的工作是帮他们找到更好的方法表达。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["发脾气", "理解", "正常发展", "父母角色"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00026", "b00027"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a021", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "父母应对孩子发脾气", "reason": "a020强调理解孩子发脾气，a021要求父母保持冷静，两者都是父母应对孩子发脾气的必要行为。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "父母在行为上保持冷静", "content": "当孩子发脾气时，父母一定在行为上要保持冷静。如果孩子发脾气时父母也发脾气，孩子崩溃时父母也崩溃，就无法帮助孩子。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["冷静", "父母行为", "情绪管理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a021", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00027", "b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a020", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "理解孩子后保持冷静", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u021"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "孩子有权获得任何情感", "content": "孩子有权获得任何情感。父母要清晰地指认孩子的情绪。例如，孩子看电视十分钟后要关电视，孩子大发雷霆，父母生气，但孩子当然可以发脾气。父母要做的是帮助孩子指出生气的原因，如“刚刚看到一半，还差最后关键时刻，要关电视，所以你很生气”。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["情感权利", "指认情绪", "发脾气"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a022", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00028", "b00029", "b00030"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a023", "kind": "supports", "condition": "帮助孩子指认情绪", "reason": "a022提到父母要清晰指认孩子的情绪，a023提供具体方法，两者相互支持。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u022"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "帮助孩子指认情绪", "content": "帮助孩子指认情绪的方法：不要整天盯着孩子看哪里做得不好，要建立育儿体系。当孩子发脾气时，指出他们生气的原因，例如“刚刚看到一半，还差最后关键的时刻，要关电视，所以你很生气”。", "steps": ["观察孩子情绪", "用语言描述情绪原因", "表达理解"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["指认情绪", "育儿体系", "情绪原因"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a023", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00030"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a022", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "指认情绪是尊重情感权利的具体做法", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a025", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "用语言命名情绪", "reason": "a023指出帮助孩子指认情绪，a025进一步说明用语言命名情绪的好处，指认是命名的基础。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u023"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "对3-4岁孩子要有同情心", "content": "对3-4岁孩子一定要有同情心。这个年龄的孩子“狗都嫌”，但不管孩子多么闹腾，这是他在遇到困难时，也许是非常激烈的方式，但也许是他为数不多知道的方式之一。孩子很可怜，要说说不出来，很多情况下没有决定权。父母要体会孩子的困境，在我们眼中简单的事情，孩子看来可能很困难。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["同情心", "3-4岁", "困境"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a024", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00031", "b00032"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a026", "kind": "supports", "condition": "对3-4岁孩子要有同情心", "reason": "a024强调同情心，a026提出同情加称赞的方法，同情心是该方法的基础。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u024"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "用语言命名和解释情绪", "content": "发脾气最好的选择是通过语言表达情感。如果孩子可以说“我很生气”，甚至“我生气，因为他拿走我的玩具了”，他们就可以专注用语言表达感受，而不是觉得消沉。孩子发脾气后整个人非常消沉，身体机能关闭。如果帮助孩子用语言命名情绪，如“这种情绪叫嫉妒”“这种情绪叫愤怒”“这种情绪叫暴怒”，孩子就可以更好地控制情绪之下的行为。", "steps": ["鼓励孩子用语言表达情绪", "帮助孩子命名情绪", "解释情绪原因"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["语言表达", "命名情绪", "情绪控制"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a025", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00032", "b00033", "b00034"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:nl-c-23", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：引导孩子健康表达情绪时；区别：旧原子在限制中提到命名情绪，候选提供具体方法。", "reason": "提供用语言命名和解释情绪的具体操作，符合旧原子限制中的健康表达。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u025"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "3-4岁情绪连接方法：同情加称赞", "content": "3-4岁情绪连接方法一：同情加称赞。帮助孩子认识到挫折、困难、失败总是会发生的，但更重要的是孩子怎样处理。例如“哇哦，这个真的好难哦，你居然走出一步，很不容易。对于你来讲，这是非常难的一件事情，但是哇塞，你居然做到了”。", "steps": ["表达同情", "称赞孩子的努力", "强调处理方式"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["同情", "称赞", "挫折处理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a026", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00034", "b00035"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a027", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "3-4岁情绪连接方法", "reason": "a026和a027都是3-4岁情绪连接的方法，并列关系。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u026"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "3-4岁情绪连接方法：讲故事", "content": "3-4岁情绪连接方法二：讲故事。故事不单单向孩子提供很多情绪词汇，而且把孩子带进创造性的环境。很多儿童心理学家和教育者告诉父母晚上给孩子读书的重要性，因为这是用故事促进儿童情感发展的关键核心。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["讲故事", "情绪词汇", "情感发展"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a027", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00036"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a028", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "3-4岁情绪连接方法", "reason": "a027和a028都是3-4岁情绪连接的方法，并列关系。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u027"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "3-4岁情绪连接方法：用积极语言", "content": "3-4岁情绪连接方法三：用积极语言。父母常说“不要去碰”“不准去那边”“停停停”“不要摸”等负面词。如果只用这些词，孩子很快会失去这些词的力量，例如说100遍“不要拖拉”孩子还是拖拉。要把负面词改成正面积极的词，如“不要那么拖拉”改成“要快一点”，“不准去碰那个”改成“你现在可以玩这个”，“不要吃那么多甜的”改成“来吃一些青菜”。", "steps": ["识别负面语言", "替换为正面积极语言", "给出具体指令"], "conditions": [], "limits": ["负面词有时必要，但不能只用负面词"], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["积极语言", "负面语言", "指令"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a028", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00036", "b00037", "b00038", "b00039"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a029", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "3-4岁情绪连接方法", "reason": "a028和a029都是3-4岁情绪连接的方法，并列关系。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u028"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "3-4岁情绪连接方法：庆祝小进步", "content": "3-4岁情绪连接方法四：庆祝孩子获得的一小点进步。例如孩子今天用语言试着表达情绪，哪怕非常简单的一个词，都要及时指出来。如果平时孩子扔东西，今天没有扔，说“不高兴”，要及时指出：“哇塞，你今天没有尖叫，上次有尖叫，今天没有，只是按了一下，妈妈都以为你要尖叫了，但是你没有。”久而久之可以建立自信心。", "steps": ["观察孩子的进步", "及时指出并庆祝", "具体描述进步"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["内在能力"], "tags": ["庆祝进步", "自信心", "情绪表达"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a029", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00039", "b00040"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c002:v2-n001", "kind": "conditional_difference", "condition": "源适用于5-8岁孩子，候选1适用于3-4岁孩子", "reason": "源和候选1描述的都是“及时指出具体进步以建立自信心”，内容几乎相同（例如“今天没有尖叫，只是按了一下”），但适用年龄不同：源明确为5-8岁，候选1明确为3-4岁情绪连接方法之一。因此方法相同但条件存在年龄差异，标为 conditional_difference。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u029"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "5-8岁情绪管理任务", "content": "5-8岁孩子在情绪上最主要的一个任务是帮助孩子管理、梳理他们的情绪。这个阶段孩子准备进入学校：5岁进入学前班，6-7岁开始进入学校；面对新的社会环境和更大的独立性（因为在学校的日子里不是每天都跟着父母），有很多机会也有挑战。孩子开始面对很多挑战，分享、倾听和一起玩耍会导致孩子之间有很多摩擦，而且父母不在身边，不能随时依靠父母，所以必须适应新的应对技巧，发展自我管理。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["5-8岁", "情绪管理", "学校适应", "自我管理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-695e744eaddd-c001:a030", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-695e744eaddd", "blocks": ["b00040", "b00041", "b00042", "b00043"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-695e744eaddd-c002:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当5-8岁儿童进入学校时", "reason": "“5-8岁情绪管理任务”详细说明孩子进入学校面对新环境、机会和挑战，支持了“5-8岁儿童面临学校环境带来的成长机会与挑战”的概括。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "支持关系成立。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-695e744eaddd-c001:u030", "s-695e744eaddd-c002:u001", "s-695e744eaddd-c002:u002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
